  winStoryText: {fileID: 0}
  winContinueButton: {fileID: 0}
  winStoryMessage: "Across the world, rising temperatures are drying up the rivers that beavers call home, forcing nature's smallest engineers to build dams out of human trash just to survive another day. Plastic only delays the drought, but true restoration brings the water back to life. Today, you helped one beaver hold back the dry season and proved that our rivers are still worth fighting for. When we replace waste with care, we don't just save a stream\u2014we build hope."
